WEBVTT

00:15:28.536 --> 00:15:30.503
Ti ke marre enderrat

00:15:30.503 --> 00:15:32.115
e atij djali nente vjecar,

00:15:32.115 --> 00:15:33.754
te cilat ishin te pamunduara

00:15:33.754 --> 00:15:36.644
dhe te frikshme,

00:15:36.644 --> 00:15:38.344
tmerrruese,

00:15:38.344 --> 00:15:41.068
dhe i vendose ne praktike,

00:15:41.068 --> 00:15:44.301
dhe gjete nje menyre sesi 
ta riprogramoje veten,

00:15:44.301 --> 00:15:46.429
te ndryshoje friken tende primare

00:15:46.429 --> 00:15:49.328
qe te lejonte te ktheheshe pas

00:15:49.328 --> 00:15:53.268
me nje sere eksperiencash 
dhe nje nivel inspirimi

00:15:53.268 --> 00:15:54.611
per njerezit e tjere

00:15:54.611 --> 00:15:57.737
qe nuk do te ishte e mundur ndryshe.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:05.347
Per ta mbyllur, me kerkuan te luaj me kitare.